    {
      "id": "claim_5ea3a5940a7048d48e32ee631550343e",
      "statement": "Per-user bring-your-own provider credentials are explicitly out of scope for ADR-0001: they remain per-run and BFF-encrypted, are never centralized into Komodo or Vault, and a request lacking a per-user credential fails closed with no shared-secret fallback.",
      "evidence": [
